><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Hannah</surname><given-names>MJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Lui-Roberts</surname><given-names>WWY</given-names></name><name><surname>Norman</surname><given-names>KE</given-names></name><name><surname>Cutler</surname><given-names>DF</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>P-selectin and CD63 use different mechanisms for delivery to Weibel-Palade bodies</article-title><source>Traffic</source><year>2006</year><volume>7</volume><fpage>647</fpage><lpage>62</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16683915</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1111/j.1600-0854.2006.00415.x</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B6"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Ramires</surname><given-names>PA</given-names></name><name><surname>Giufrida</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Milella</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Three-dimensional reconstruction of confocal laser microscopy images to study the behaviour of osteoblastic cells grown on biomaterials</article-title><source>Biomaterials</source><year>2002</year><volume>23</volume><fpage>397</fpage><lpage>406</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11761159</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0142-9612(01)00118-1</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B7"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Williams</surname><given-names>JM</given-names></name><name><surname>Buchanan</surname><given-names>RA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Ion implantation of surgical Ti-6Al-4V alloy</article-title><source>Mater Sci Eng</source><year>1985</year><volume>69</volume><fpage>237</fpage><lpage>46</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/0025-5416(85)90398-2</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B8"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Long</surname><given-names>M</given-names><