><given-names>CR</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Culture of human endothelial cells derived from umbilical veins &#x02013; identification by morphologic and immunologic criteria</article-title><source>J Clin Invest</source><year>1973</year><volume>52</volume><fpage>2745</fpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">4355998</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1172/JCI107470</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B24"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Dixit</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Hern-Anderson</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Ranieri</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Schmidt</surname><given-names>CE</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Vascular graft endothelization: comparative analysis of canine and human endothelial cell migration on natural biomaterials</article-title><source>J Biomed Mater Res</source><year>2001</year><volume>56</volume><fpage>545</fpage><lpage>55</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11400132</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1002/1097-4636(20010915)56:4&#x0003c;545::AID-JBM1126&#x0003e;3.0.CO;2-V</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B25"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>van Kooten</surname><given-names>TG</given-names></name><name><surname>Klein</surname><given-names>CL</given-names></name><name><surname>Kirkpatrick</surname><given-names>CJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Cell-cycle control in cell-biomaterial interactions: expression of p53 and Ki67 in human umbilical vein endothelial cells in direct contact and extract testing of biomaterials</article-title><source>J Biomed Mater Res</source><year>2000</year><volume>52</volume><fpage>199</fpage><lpage>209</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10906693</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1002/1097-4636(200010)52:1&#x0003c;199::AID-JBM26&#x0003e;3.0.CO;2-Z</pub-id></citati